WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.511
Zariski's multiplicity question fails.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:08.227
Zariski asked whether the embedded topology of a singularity determines its multiplicity.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.537
In high dimensions, the Seifert form decides

4
00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:13.625
topology; match it, change the degree.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.983
Claimed: no, with multiplicities two and three.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.221
No Lean proof yet.
